{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run/draft && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\nimport json\nsub={\n \\\"action\\\":\\\"review\\\",\n \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Semantic review of the direct check for C1-recovery-adopts-committed-vector. The check executed on the trusted runner (be74405317044c1fa5f5151c7815c026), the monitor outcome is violated with comparison_observed true, and this item assesses whether the encoded predicate, the entry duties, the oracle, the identity, the legal history and the observation path correspond to the written requirement rather than only to the output.\\\",\n \\\"artifact_id\\\":\\\"6a3e98cc754c4a21a2374ad59f78c7e1\\\",\n \\\"review_items\\\":[{\n   \\\"aspect\\\":\\\"checker_correspondence\\\",\n   \\\"status\\\":\\\"no_issue_found\\\",\n   \\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"S14-recovery-start-prepare\\\",\\\"S15-handlePrepareReply\\\",\\\"S13-handleCommit\\\",\\\"S11-handleAccept\\\",\\\"S12-handleAcceptReply\\\"],\n   \\\"report_title\\\":\\\"恢复阶段忽略已提交回复\\\",\n   \\\"report_answer\\\":\\\"构造历史中恢复者把新 ballot 当作自己的 VBallot 上报，使 vbal=0 的 COMMITTED 回复被 element.VBallot >= lb.ballot 的比较跳过：实例最终停留在 PREACCEPTED 并以 NOOP 重新进入阶段 1（adopted_committed=false），而对端仍持有已提交命令。该观察的适用范围限于检查声明的前置条件（直接进入 startRecoveryForInstance、对端已提交记录为预备状态），接受阶段的后续完成与执行后果不在本次检查范围内。\\\",\n   \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Requirement versus predicate: the accepted claim is that a slow-quorum reply reporting the instance COMMITTED must be adopted; the plan's observable property asserts adopted_committed on the resolution event, and the harness prints instance_status and command_after in the same event, so the assertion is checkable against the raw fields rather than only through the derived boolean. Entry and caller duties: the recovery is entered directly through startRecoveryForInstance instead of the executeCommands timeout, and the peer's COMMITTED record is prepared rather than produced by a proposal and commit round; both substitutions are declared in the claim's scope and in the harness legality, and neither is needed for the resolution step the claim is about, because the resolution reads only the record, the reply slice and the running ballot. Oracle: adopted_committed is computed by the harness as an OR of two status fields, and the same event carries the status the code actually stored, so a change in the protocol's status semantics would show up in instance_status as well. Identity: the prerequisite and the resolution event share instance 1.0, which is the instance the harness seeds and drives, so correlation is non-trivial and monotone; the identity is written by the harness rather than read from the record, which is noted as a limitation rather than a defect because the harness constructs exactly one instance. Legal history: the prepared COMMITTED record corresponds to a state some history produced, but the trigger path is substituted, so the item is scoped to the resolution decision. Observation path and completion: all handlers are synchronous in the harness, the resolution is observed after handlePrepareReply returns, and the emitted message code is retained, so no wait or join is implied. Counterevidence: the alternative reading (the local record's new ballot legitimately outranks an older committed vbal) is recorded in the claim grounding and is not settled by this check; the item therefore does not promote the finding beyond the reviewed correspondence of predicate and observation.\\\",\n   \\\"counterevidence\\\":[\\\"scoped to legality: the trigger (execution timeout) and the production of the committed record are substituted, so the check does not establish that a full history reaches the seeded state\\\",\\\"scoped to the normative basis: the obligation rests on the role of recovery in EPaxos (the value that could have been committed is the one with the highest vbal among a slow quorum) rather than on an in-repository document, so the alternative reading remains open\\\"],\n   \\\"limitations\\\":[\\\"the harness computes adopted_committed as an OR of instance Status and leader bookkeeping status; the raw status is printed in the same event\\\",\\\"instance identity is a harness literal because the harness drives one instance\\\",\\\"the consequence after the resolution (accept-round completion, execution divergence) is outside this check and remains a separate question\\\"]\n }]\n}\njson.dump(sub,open('submission-review.json','w'),indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('ok')\nPY\ncd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run --submission submission-review.json 2>&1 | head -30\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
